<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Richards returns three months after intake. She has taken vitamin D3 2000 units every day and keeps her calcium at about 1200 mg a day from food. She collected the 24-hour urine sample over the weekend, and the result came back this morning with her blood tests. Her routine dental examination three weeks ago found no problems and no dental work is planned. She finished all 16 sessions of the balance and strength program four days ago and now does the home program three times a week. She has had no falls. She has had no alcohol. She has read about the infusion and asked about the flu-like reaction that can follow a first dose. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Vitamin D</td><td>D3 2000 units daily, no missed doses</td></tr><tr><td>Dental status</td><td>Routine examination three weeks ago; no work planned</td></tr><tr><td>Balance program</td><td>16 of 16 sessions; home program three times a week</td></tr><tr><td>Falls</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>Recovery</td><td>No alcohol; no cravings</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

