    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No bone, back, or thigh pain</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No kidney stones or urinary symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever or recent illness; drinking plenty of fluid today</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; no cravings; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

